```

### 7. Add Error‑Handling Middleware (A10)

```js
// Generic error handler – keep stack traces out of responses in prod
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
  console.error(err); // logs go to stdout → can be collected by log aggregator

  const status = err.status || 500;
  const message = process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production'
    ? 'Internal server error'
    : err.message;

  res.status(status).json({ error: message });
});
```

### 8. Content‑Security‑Policy (CSP) (A6)

If you ever serve HTML, set a restrictive CSP via Helmet:

```js
app.use(
  helmet.contentSecurityPolicy({
    directives: {
      defaultSrc: ["'self'"],
      scriptSrc: ["'self'"],
      styleSrc: ["'self'"],
      imgSrc: ["'self'"],
      // add other directives as needed
    },
  })
);
```

