| **Implement secret rotation and least‑privilege IAM** | Limits blast‑radius of a leaked secret | Configure IAM policies and rotation schedules |
| **Add CI test** to verify required secrets are present | Guard against missing vars in CI/CD | Include test file in repo |
| **Avoid logging secret values** | Prevent leakage in logs | Log only names, not values |

