## Checklist for Ongoing Security Hygiene

| ✅ | Action |
|----|--------|
| **Dependency hygiene** | Run `npm audit && npm audit fix` regularly; enable Dependabot. |
| **Secrets management** | Load all credentials from environment variables or secret stores. |
| **Transport security** | Deploy behind HTTPS (TLS termination). |
| **Authentication** | Implement JWT (or session) + secure password storage. |
| **Authorization** | RBAC / ABAC per endpoint. |
| **Input validation** | Use a schema validator (`joi`, `zod`, `express-validator`). |
